OL,3,GNEWSAExtra funding for care leavers
OL,4,Aapproved by council
OL,5,
OL,6,FCare leavers in Nottingham will receive
OL,7,Fextra financial support after the city
OL,8,Fcouncil approved a #300,000 scheme.
OL,10,FThe Care Leaver Grant Fund will
OL,11,F"provide practical financial support
OL,12,Fand opportunities for care-experienced
OL,13,Fyoung people as they make the
OL,14,Ftransition into adulthood", Nottingham
OL,15,FCity Council said.
OL,17,FIt will run over a two-year period from
OL,18,F2027 and help care leavers aged 18 to
OL,19,F25, with the authority working with The
OL,20,FKing's Trust on the project.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
