OL,3,GNEWSAExtra funding for care leavers
OL,4,Aapproved by council
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe city council said it was "part of a
OL,7,Fwider package" of more than #20m funded
OL,8,Fthrough an underspend in the council's
OL,9,F2025-26 budget.
